            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 3 GHz Intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> DirectX 10.x or OpenGL 3.3 or better graphics card with 1 GB RAM and support for v4 shaders<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 10<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 7 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Caution: ATI Mobility Radeon HD 5xxx, 1GB VRAM 5000 series, AMD processor may not work properly with this game.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 8.1 (64bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 3.1 GHz Intel i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> DirectX 10.x or OpenGL 3.3 or better graphics card with 2 GB RAM and support for v4 shaders<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 10<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 7 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Caution: ATI Mobility Radeon HD 5xxx, 1GB VRAM 5000 series, AMD processor may not work properly with this game.</li></ul>"
